## Overview

This lesson introduces asynchronous programming in JavaScript. The exercises demonstrate how JavaScript handles tasks that take time to complete without stopping the rest of the program from running.

The lesson covers:

- Synchronous vs Asynchronous JavaScript
- Callbacks
- Callback Hell
- Promises
- Promise Chaining
- Async/Await
- Error Handling with `try...catch`
- Running multiple asynchronous tasks with `Promise.all()`

---

